    "You can still review and practise the words you learned. Choose another collection to learn new words." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bạn vẫn ôn và luyện được từ đã học. Chọn Collection khác để học từ mới."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आप सीखे हुए शब्द अब भी दोहरा और अभ्यास कर सकते हैं। नए शब्द सीखने के लिए कोई दूसरा संग्रह चुनें।"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún puedes repasar y practicar las palabras que aprendiste. Elige otra colección para aprender palabras nuevas."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "学習済みの単語は引き続き復習・練習できます。新しい単語を学ぶには、別のコレクションを選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você ainda pode revisar e praticar as palavras que aprendeu. Escolha outra coleção para aprender palavras novas."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "학습한 단어는 계속 복습하고 연습할 수 있어요. 새 단어를 학습하려면 다른 컬렉션을 선택하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你仍可以複習和練習學過的單字。選擇另一個單字集來學新單字。"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "คุณยังทบทวนและฝึกคำที่เรียนแล้วได้ เลือกคอลเลกชันอื่นเพื่อเรียนคำใหม่"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يزال بإمكانك مراجعة الكلمات التي تعلّمتها والتدرّب عليها. اختر مجموعة أخرى لتعلّم كلمات جديدة."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kamu masih bisa mengulas dan melatih kata yang sudah dipelajari. Pilih koleksi lain untuk mempelajari kata baru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can still review and practise the words you learned. Choose another topic or collection to learn new words." : {
